Wrote `coder-2.json` with one row for the misinformation topic. The only source (AB 587, which Gabriel authored) requires transparency/reporting on content-moderation practices, not removal, labeling, voluntary standards, or a free-speech/no-government-involvement stance — that dimension isn't ordered by the served rungs, so I coded V2 `adjacent`/V4 `off-axis` and BLANKed the row `no-evidence`, flagging a need for his own statement to establish a chair.
